<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Datos de Sesión - Sistema de Casas</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-LN+7fdVzj6u52u30Kp6M/trliBMCMKTyK833zpbD+pXdCLuTusPj697FH4R/5mcr" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001f3e 0%, #003d7a 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .main-header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            animation: slideDown 0.6s ease-out;
        }
        
        @keyframes slideDown {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        
        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }
        
        .main-header h1 {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001f3e 0%, #003d7a 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .logout-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7675 0%, #fd79a8 100%);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .logout-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 118, 117, 0.4);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .session-container {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            animation: slideUp 0.8s ease-out;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .session-icon {
            font-size: 5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7675 0%, #fd79a8 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        .session-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001f3e 0%, #003d7a 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .session-message {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #636e72;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .action-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .btn-action {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001f3e 0%, #003d7a 100%);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            min-width: 150px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .btn-action:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 31, 62, 0.4);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary-action {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74b9ff 0%, #0984e3 100%);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            min-width: 150px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary-action:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(116, 185, 255, 0.4);
            color: white;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .main-header {
                padding: 1rem;
                margin: 1rem;
                border-radius: 15px;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            
            .main-header h1 {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }
            
            .session-container {
                margin: 1rem;
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
                border-radius: 15px;
            }
            
            .session-icon {
                font-size: 3.5rem;
            }
            
            .session-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .session-message {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            
            .action-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            .btn-action,
            .btn-secondary-action {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 250px;
            }
        }
        
        .container-fluid {
            max-width: 1200px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="main-header">
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between">
                <h1><i class="fas fa-user-shield me-3"></i>Datos de Sesión</h1>
                <a href="/auth/logout" class="logout-btn">
                    <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt me-2"></i>Cerrar Sesión
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="session-container">
            <div class="session-icon">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>
            </div>
            
            <h2 class="session-title">¡Sin Sesión Activa!</h2>
            
            <p class="session-message">
                No se ha detectado una sesión válida en el sistema. Para acceder a las funcionalidades, 
                necesitas iniciar sesión con tus credenciales.
            </p>
            
            <div class="action-buttons">
                <a href="/auth/login-vista" class="btn-action">
                    <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-2"></i>Iniciar Sesión
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        integrity="sha384-ndDqU0Gzau9qJ1lfW4pNLlhNTkCfHzAVBReH9diLvGRem5+R9g2FzA8ZGN954O5Q"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>